      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "electricity"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The robot releases a surge of energy, dealing 2d6 Electricity Damage damage to all adjacent creatures (Basic DC 14 Reflex Saving Throw save). It can't use Jolting Arc again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
